Have you tried the 'recover' command?  It restores you game to the last
checkpoint.  The source code is distributed with the rest of nethack.

Recover doesn't always fix things, I have had games which could be
recovered, but crashed every time I started them up. 

If you want to keep on playing before you can get recover working,
just change your player's name in your .nethackrc file, and start
a new game.  Just remove the entry later when you are ready to try recover.

